Objective: Capture Cooler in 50 turns

Planet: Cooler
Clan: Crimson Path

Notes: The Chosen have established control of the central continent of Cooler.  Unfortunately, our surreptitious surveys have found that Cooler is an excellent source of minerals we need to implement the master plan. We have found an uncurious Concord sponsor to allow you to take over the planet as if it was a normal takeover.

